The '''sanguine torva full helm''' is a [[Torva full helm]] modified by an [[ancient blood ornament kit]] and 20,000 [[blood rune]]s; the kit is not consumed. The ornament gives no additional bonuses, and is purely cosmetic.

While the item is untradeable in its sanguine state, it can be reverted anytime. However, the blood runes will not be returned.

